{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a7228ba01f1ed6f5ac7e2e91273088fd8be79a20979c399b6a89435813c1e141", "ja": "（ヤンキーを題材とするドラマに雪歩が出演する。\n凶悪なヤンキーという難しい役どころだが……）", "zh": "（雪步要出演一部以不良少年为题材的电视剧。虽然是个难度很高的凶恶不良少年角色……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "276ef3efda8af60d01f46fb6e7f6b3fa09c63d00f6f8abfd6d175b062b247287", "ja": "「ひ、ひとり残らず倒してやるぜぇ！　覚悟しろぉ！」\n……うーん、やっぱり迫力に欠けるかなぁ。", "zh": "“一、一个不留地把你们全都打趴下！给我觉悟吧！”\n……唔——果然还是不够有威慑力呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2df3ae3f64356020f488a86c012061d7766fe689445d1290bf7ef85471fca13f", "ja": "お疲れ様、雪歩。演技のレッスン中かな？", "zh": "辛苦了，雪步。是在上演技课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "eb0ae3be01175e94ebbe4baf602ab354612ba81599fb1286a632eb2f64e5366c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nそうなんです、本番はまだしばらく先ですけど……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n是的，正式演出还要过一阵子，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5a48a6da4b2f79ab29171a96e29972c4c7b7fcc3cc5b5d90a0041e3282f6ca19", "ja": "今のうちに、レッスンしておいた方がいいかなって。\n今回は慣れないヤンキーさんの役ですし……。", "zh": "我想趁现在先练习一下比较好。\n毕竟这次演的是自己不太熟悉的不良少女角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1005_p", "source_sha256": "50e1e4b94b6b2bef02fcfeebcebbd168f8ae04a3fd890c4351521b3d52108dbd", "ja": "なるほどな。でも、『凶悪なヤンキー』ってこと\n以外はまだ設定が固まってないって話だったよな。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，我记得除了“凶恶的不良”以外，其他设定还没确定下来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f4bb10a06d0dc9d923d967d4b1b12dc8825ad5be63c958e11c179d5dbe35de05", "ja": "そうなんです。詳細が決まったら追って連絡するって\n話で。だから今は私の想像で練習してたんですけど……", "zh": "就是这样。对方说等细节确定后会再联系我，所以我现在只能凭自己的想象练习，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "52dae74e7e78e2f8bf3156fbb2f44bf9d6c5f21c145777c8b44328b6486e5426", "ja": "こう、『凶悪』な……。威勢というか、迫力があって\n怖い！　って感じがどうしても出せなくて……。", "zh": "就是那种“凶恶”的……我怎么都表现不出那种气势十足、充满魄力，让人觉得好可怕的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1008_p", "source_sha256": "757023e5cdae46f82260a0403c6e33ccbab97fe4332f0e8a080101d260b26818", "ja": "うーん、威勢よく、迫力があるって以外にも、恐ろしい\nヤンキーを表現する方法はありそうだけどな。", "zh": "嗯——除了表现出气势十足、魄力满满之外，应该也还有其他表现恐怖不良少年的方法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "16831b85e44a641a48120e42307b03d8bb6d6cadafda1afd6f89bc439ad8cbd2", "ja": "他の方法、ですか……？　うぅ、ごめんなさい。\nあまりイメージができなくって……。", "zh": "其他方法吗……？呜呜，对不起。我实在想象不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1010_p", "source_sha256": "07f09fc36e52fe3d457887852eb1f4a2b8a3238588bfa797596e0390746169b5", "ja": "そもそも雪歩に名指しでオファーが来たわけだし、雪歩\nが無理して演じるような役にはならないんじゃないか？", "zh": "说到底，这次可是点名邀请雪步来出演的，所以应该不会是那种需要雪步勉强去演的角色吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4717d4af641fcf7bebb36f8adbccb325567943374c0189612f47b3fcb5997b04", "ja": "無理をしない……うーん、そしたらあまり大声を\n出さなくってもいいのかなぁ？　例えば……", "zh": "不勉强……嗯，这样的话，是不是不用喊太大声也可以呢？比如说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3b99bc1da6c8dbeea0d340a5f5e8d59588cd3db1a6f98a20ae04032b124c6283", "ja": "「……ふふっ。一人残らず、消してあげますぅ。\nみなさん、穴に埋まる覚悟はできてますね……？」", "zh": "“……呵呵。一个不留，全都给你们收拾掉唷。\n各位，都做好被埋进坑里的觉悟了吧……？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ee517e0a550756cd9df8275013e6fc7c191fd7d3e249d104204a21b183b6bc21", "ja": "（ぞくっ……！）", "zh": "（一阵寒意袭来……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "21accb1db0f9c4c35153fefa04d8f42c5092be20817c1c3c99a3d2dcb74736e0", "ja": "ど、どうですか？　\n少し丁寧な言い方を意識してみたんですけど……！", "zh": "怎、怎么样？\n我试着注意了一下措辞，让说法更礼貌一些……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bfc1d5f7170b4582aff5e1734c73995882babfc43c43b1400fd92c57abd41e79", "ja": "あ、ああ！　雪歩らしさも感じられる、いいキャラ\nだな！　監督さんも気に入ってくれると思うぞ！", "zh": "啊、啊啊！也能感受到雪步的风格，是个不错的角色！我想导演也会喜欢的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fc882e1e37ebb36d053a3ae7993c68fa5921a5a90bb8e4e5da6aeaaead6874c1", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？　よかったぁ～。\nそれじゃあ、この方向性で練習を続けてみますぅ！", "zh": "真、真的吗！？太好了～。\n那我就沿着这个方向继续练习了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0373_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9992ff339476ac0f8dc7224456f3171c0b2a8259be5afbb6e1e773bb69d6a4ec", "ja": "（その後、本番も雪歩考案のキャラで演じる\nこととなり、視聴者に大好評だったようだ！）", "zh": "（之后，正式演出也决定让雪步用她设计的角色来表演，似乎大受观众好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
